-- Cells with their chromosomes, at a phase of mitosis or meiosis. Each Cell subtype carries its own placement rules.
type Cell
type MitosisMetaphase <: Cell
type MeiosisMetaphaseI <: Cell
type MeiosisAnaphaseI <: Cell
type MeiosisLateAnaphaseI <: Cell
type Chromosome

predicate In(Chromosome, Cell)
symmetric predicate Homologous(Chromosome, Chromosome)
predicate Paternal(Chromosome)
predicate Maternal(Chromosome)
predicate Short(Chromosome)
